<section id="camp" class="sec light">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-rv>08 · The Camp</p>
    <h2 class="sec-title" data-rv>A palace woven from canvas</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub" data-rv>Deep in the erg, far beyond the last track, our private camp appears like a dream the dunes are having: lantern-lit, silent, impossibly comfortable.</p>
    <div class="cgrid">
      <figure class="cmain" data-rv="left">
        <img src="https://image.qwenlm.ai/public_source/59e3c0a3-0889-46ea-884f-ad206b7115d9/1b4723713-ece7-4ada-8f84-e450693a99b7.png" alt="Luxury desert camp tents glowing at blue hour among Erg Chegaga dunes" loading="lazy">
        <div class="cglass">
          <div><b>8</b><span>Private suites</span></div>
