    <div class="flist" data-rv>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">How do I reach Foum Zguid?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Fly into Marrakech or Ouarzazate. From there it's a spectacular 5–6 hour drive through the Anti-Atlas — or let us arrange a private transfer with stops at Aït Ben Haddou and the Draa palm groves. The road is paved, safe and astonishing.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">When is the best time to visit?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>October to April: warm 20–28°C days and crisp star-filled nights. Summer is for the bold — dramatic light, empty dunes, early starts and long siestas.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">What is the camp really like?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Think boutique hotel, minus the walls. King beds with real linens, private bathrooms with hot eco-showers, solar lanterns, a chef from the oasis, and a silence no five-star lobby has ever achieved.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">Is it suitable for children?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Joyfully. From age six, children ride camels, board dunes, bake bread in sand ovens and meet Saturn through the telescope. Family tents sleep four.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">Can you cater dietary needs?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, allergies — our chef adapts every menu with notice. Oasis vegetables and dates feature beautifully either way.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">Is the Sahara safe?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Morocco is among the calmest destinations in Africa, and our region is its quietest corner. Guides are first-aid certified, vehicles carry satellite phones, and camels are inspected like royalty.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="fitem"><button aria-expanded="false">What is your cancellation policy?<span class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></button><div class="fa"><div><p>Full refund up to 14 days before arrival; 50% up to 7 days; dates can always be moved once, free of charge. The desert understands changed plans.</p></div></div></div>
